
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ meta.mainLanguage }}">
    <head>
        <title>Nothing here — Neverwood Academy</title>
        <link href="/styles/digital-garden-base.css" rel="stylesheet">
        {%-if meta.themeStyle%}
            <link href="/styles/obsidian-base.css" rel="stylesheet">
            <link href="{{meta.themeStyle}}" rel="stylesheet">
        {% else %}
            <link href="/styles/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
        {%endif%}
        <link href="/styles/custom-style.css" rel="stylesheet">
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600&family=Lato:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <style>
            body.nw-404 {
                margin: 0;
                min-height: 100vh;
                background: #2a1f3d;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
            }
            .nw-star {
                position: absolute;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: #fff;
                opacity: 0;
                animation: nw-twinkle 3s infinite;
            }
            @keyframes nw-twinkle {
                0%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8); }
                50% { opacity: 0.6; transform: scale(1.2); }
            }
            .nw-content {
                text-align: center;
                position: relative;
                z-index: 2;
                max-width: 520px;
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            .nw-logo {
                width: 180px;
                margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
                animation: nw-float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
            }
            @keyframes nw-float {
                0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
                50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
            }
            .nw-num {
                font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
                font-size: 96px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #c9a84c;
                line-height: 1;
                letter-spacing: 0.1em;
                margin: 0;
            }
            .nw-title {
                font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
                font-size: 22px;
                color: #e8d9b5;
                margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
                letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            }
            .nw-scroll {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
                border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.25);
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
                margin: 1.25rem 0;
                color: #c4b89a;
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.75;
                font-style: italic;
            }
            .nw-scroll strong {
                color: #e8d9b5;
                font-style: normal;
            }
            .nw-divider {
                color: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.5);
                font-size: 13px;
                letter-spacing: 0.2em;
                margin: 1rem 0;
            }
            .nw-sub {
                color: #c4b89a;
                font-size: 14px;
                margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }
            .nw-btn {
                display: inline-block;
                font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
                font-size: 14px;
                letter-spacing: 0.08em;
                color: #2a1f3d;
                background: #c9a84c;
                border-radius: 6px;
                padding: 0.75rem 2.25rem;
                text-decoration: none;
                transition: background 0.2s;
            }
            .nw-btn:hover {
                background: #e0bc62;
            }
            .nw-footnote {
                color: rgba(196, 184, 154, 0.4);
                font-size: 12px;
                margin-top: 1.5rem;
                letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body class="nw-404">
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:2px;height:2px;top:8%;left:12%;animation-delay:0s"></span>
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:3px;height:3px;top:15%;left:75%;animation-delay:0.7s"></span>
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:2px;height:2px;top:60%;left:88%;animation-delay:1.2s"></span>
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:2px;height:2px;top:80%;left:20%;animation-delay:0.4s"></span>
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:3px;height:3px;top:35%;left:5%;animation-delay:1.8s"></span>
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:2px;height:2px;top:25%;left:90%;animation-delay:2.3s"></span>
        <span class="nw-star" style="width:2px;height:2px;top:70%;left:55%;animation-delay:0.9s"></span>

        <div class="nw-content">
            <img class="nw-logo" src="/img/user/z_Assets/website/Light%20tran%20logo.png" alt="Neverwood Academy" />
            <p class="nw-num">404</p>
            <p class="nw-title">Page Not Found</p>
            <div class="nw-scroll">
                Dear wandering student — it appears this page has been enchanted with an
                <strong>invisibility charm</strong>, or perhaps it never existed at all.
                Even the enchanted map of Neverwood Academy cannot locate it.
            </div>
            <div class="nw-divider">✦ &nbsp; ✦ &nbsp; ✦</div>
            <p class="nw-sub">If you followed a link here, this note may not yet have been made public.</p>
            <a class="nw-btn" href="/">Return to the Home Page</a>
            <p class="nw-footnote">Neverwood Academy &middot; Est. in the age of the First Enchanters</p>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
